  "description": {
    "en": "Yonex PolyTour Air 125 is the comfort-oriented member of the PolyTour family. It combines polyester monofilament with HR-Elastomer to reduce impact stress while maintaining repulsion and durability. Designed for slow-to-medium swing speeds, it provides effortless power, excellent shock absorption and some of the deepest ball pocketing in the Yonex polyester lineup. Compared with firmer strings such as PolyTour Strike, Rev or Spin, PolyTour Air offers a much softer and more arm-friendly response.",

    "zh": "Yonex PolyTour Air 125 是 PolyTour 系列中最强调舒适性与 Arm-Friendly 的聚酯球线之一。它在 Polyester Monofilament 中加入 HR-Elastomer 高弹性材料，用于降低击球冲击和手臂负担，同时保留聚酯球线应有的回弹力和耐久性。官方定位主要面向 Slow-to-Medium Swing Speed 球员，提供 Effortless Power、优秀的 Shock Absorption 和非常明显的 Ball Pocketing。根据 Yonex 官方性能图，它位于整个 PolyTour 家族最偏 Soft 和 Ball-Pocketing 的区域之一，明显比 Strike、Rev、Spin 等型号更加柔和。"
  },

